      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Why is verification legally needed given VRChat doesn’t typically allow explicit adult content?*\n\nRedundant not x.x\n\nThis makes me concerned that VRC is moving towards being an ERP platform. I just want to socialize with adults, not ERP.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
